{"contexts":[{"attribute":"chemical_industry","confidence":"high","description":"Округ Галле был центром химической промышленности ГДР: в 1989 году химия давала 47% промышленной продукции округа и 41% всей химической продукции страны. Доля занятых в промышленности выросла с 40% до 44%, в сельском хозяйстве упала с 19% до 10%. Население округа за это время сократилось с 2,06 млн до 1,75 млн.","from":1955,"id":"de-ctx-bezirk-halle-1955-1989-chemistry","locationId":"de-bezirk-halle","sourceIds":["de_stjb_ddr"],"statistics":[{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"chemical_share_of_district_industrial_output","population":"промышленная продукция округа","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of output","value":46.9,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"district_share_of_gdr_chemical_output","population":"химическая промышленность ГДР","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of GDR output","value":41.4,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"industry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":39.5,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"industry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":44.1,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"agriculture_forestry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":19.3,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"agriculture_forestry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":9.8,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"population_thousand","population":"постоянное население округа","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"thousand persons","value":2055.3,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-halle","indicator":"population_thousand","population":"постоянное население округа","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr"